        <mxCell id="SH08-behavior" value="SH08 transitions: click Find chevron toggles independently; collapse/reopen retains query, case option and result groups. Escape within Find collapses it and focuses its header. Ctrl/Cmd+F opens Find and focuses the query. Empty query shows a prompt; no match shows explicit text. Literal search, case insensitive by default, Aa toggles case. Group matching lines by file; each result shows line number and a bounded highlighted snippet. Result click opens current source at that match, clearing historical comparison explicitly; historical-only and binary files are excluded. A repeat click reselects the match. Search is local to the already verified immutable snapshot; no network, graph execution or edits." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="752" width="1480" height="112" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="SH09-behavior" value="SH09 transitions: Full page expands the same accessible dialog to the browser viewport; Restore window returns to its former modal size. No browser fullscreen permission or new tab. Keep file, tabs, query, disclosure, commit and navigation width. Close and Escape still dismiss; Escape first closes an open actions menu or collapses focused Find. Bounds remain within viewport at small sizes. Collapse all / Open all includes Find, Files, Commits and folders. Find starts collapsed; Files and Commits start open. Read-only snapshot/history failure and Retry remain available; failure never becomes an empty successful search." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="880" width="1480" height="146" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
